    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An epic snowball fight between 2-4 players, both online and local multiplayer. Grow your snowball and use different power-up's to knock your friends out! Are you ready to Brawll?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FUN COMBAT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;SNOWBALL INCOMINGGG!&quot;</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw your snowball to knock them out. But don't miss, you are extremely vulnerable without a snowball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/8c43c42b09366a22f7bf51ab44f735bf.poster.avif?t=1752049983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/8c43c42b09366a22f7bf51ab44f735bf.webm?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/8c43c42b09366a22f7bf51ab44f735bf.mp4?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;FULL CHARGEEE!&quot;</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get in a head-to-head battle and headbutt your friends like a stubborn goat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/d89ad1255cd358355895c181ede4cf7c.poster.avif?t=1752049983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/d89ad1255cd358355895c181ede4cf7c.webm?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/d89ad1255cd358355895c181ede4cf7c.mp4?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INTERACT WITH THE MAP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map is yours to get the upper hand. Use it and surprise your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;PORTALS!&quot;</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the portals located in the map to hit them when they are not expecting! (Have you tried throwing your snowball to the portal?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/72666a48e0b7ec500509fe5005822e2c.poster.avif?t=1752049983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/72666a48e0b7ec500509fe5005822e2c.webm?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/72666a48e0b7ec500509fe5005822e2c.mp4?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>&quot;OMG! MAP IS CHANGING&quot;</strong></i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the bell, move the blocks to have some unexpected falls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>&quot;An animal takes a step and falls from the moved block you think that of me? No, I am the one who hits the bell.&quot;</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                     <strong>- Emperor Puffin</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/011c296680e172ae4a45f4deb335b9b0.poster.avif?t=1752049983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/011c296680e172ae4a45f4deb335b9b0.webm?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/011c296680e172ae4a45f4deb335b9b0.mp4?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Football Mode</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dribble through your friends, and control the ball with your own balls!!! Teamwork is important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/67df2bd05bb91ff1a2d2ccdbcc468ff9.poster.avif?t=1752049983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/67df2bd05bb91ff1a2d2ccdbcc468ff9.webm?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/67df2bd05bb91ff1a2d2ccdbcc468ff9.mp4?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOST IMPORTANTLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to have fun and show your friends that you are better than them in video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/2ae42ab9d957ccf615059e9738b1b8ef.poster.avif?t=1752049983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/2ae42ab9d957ccf615059e9738b1b8ef.webm?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/2ae42ab9d957ccf615059e9738b1b8ef.mp4?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
