1c296680e172ae4a45f4deb335b9b0.poster.avif?t=1752049983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/011c296680e172ae4a45f4deb335b9b0.webm?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/011c296680e172ae4a45f4deb335b9b0.mp4?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Football Mode</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dribble through your friends, and control the ball with your own balls!!! Teamwork is important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/67df2bd05bb91ff1a2d2ccdbcc468ff9.poster.avif?t=1752049983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/67df2bd05bb91ff1a2d2ccdbcc468ff9.webm?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/67df2bd05bb91ff1a2d2ccdbcc468ff9.mp4?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MOST IMPORTANTLY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to have fun and show your friends that you are better than them in video games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/2ae42ab9d957ccf615059e9738b1b8ef.poster.avif?t=1752049983\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/2ae42ab9d957ccf615059e9738b1b8ef.webm?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2247510/extras/2ae42ab9d957ccf615059e9738b1b8ef.mp4?t=1752049983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
